Subject: [PATCH 31/41] agent-snapshot

CDP Page.captureAgentSnapshot / Page.resolveAgentNode: cross-frame
interactive-element perception with root-viewport geometry, plus the
blink agent_snapshot collector module. Also carries the cursor-overlay
wiring in page_handler.cc/.h.
